<title>UK: UK Mill/Copthorne seeks lease to build hotel.</title>
<headline>UK Mill/Copthorne seeks lease to build hotel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British hotels and leisure group Millennium &amp; Copthorne said on Thursday it had signed an agreement to acquire a long lease to create and operate a new hotel in Manchester, northern England which would cost a total 37 million stg.</p>
</text>
